## Dead-Letter Strategy
- Invalid JSONL lines stored in gs://app-logs/invalid/ with metadata
- Include error details and line numbers for debugging
- Set up Cloud Monitoring alerts on invalid log rates
- Schedule periodic review of dead-letter contents

